\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces AnchorScore vs.\ MLLM accuracy across 78 data points (48 TeacherBehavior, 18 HandriseReadWrite, 12 BowTurnHead). Each point is one MLLM--class pair, jittered horizontally for visibility; colors and marker shapes indicate sub-datasets, and large filled markers show class means with error bars ($\pm 1$\,SD across MLLMs). The dashed line and gray band show the OLS fit and its 95\% confidence band on class means; the primary inference is the class-level correlation ($\rho =0.769$, $p=0.002$, $n=13$).}}{10}{}\protected@file@percent }
